# Black Ops: past the first prompts to Campaign, New Game and Regular, then the interrogation
# intro (about three minutes) into Operation 40; in the bar the pad walks, turns, aims down the
# sight and fires through the fight and past its checkpoint, then the pause menu's Save and Quit
# (down four times, cross, then down and cross past "Continue saving?") writes the checkpoint and
# returns to the main menu, for bo1-load.sched.
